  </p>

  <p>
    An immigrant Greek family purchased the business in 1978 and transformed a pizza parlor into a place for
    sit-down service, carryout, and the kind of comfort food that keeps people coming back.
  </p>

  <p>
    In 2000, the Villa was passed to the next generation — <strong>John Palavros</strong> (chef) and
    <strong>Amy Palavros</strong> (pastry chef) — who expanded the menu with fresh, homemade food and added
    delivery, catering, and more ways to serve the community.
  </p>

